{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":303838,\"title\":\"Smoky Mountain Wrestling\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Smoky Mountain Wrestling presents exciting in-ring action in the early-1990s, featuring SMW stars like Chris Jericho and Lance Storm.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gHxM7RqvX8mJF5cFoUo7oj4tf68.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uagMLNxKvRY4Y3R6pX25UJi1siW.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":1994,\"genres\":[\"Action & Adventure\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":4,\"totalEpisodes\":11,\"createdBy\":[\"Jim Cornette\"],\"networks\":[\"Syndication\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"1995-01-07\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1216252,\"name\":\"Les Thatcher\",\"character\":\"Les Thatcher (Color Commentator)\",\"photo\":null}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"yzKJHtYWofc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"oC42Ks13MMA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"MAGF4puoemk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":281397,\"title\":\"WWE Raw Top 10\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9icfOPDnkZlvuen08OHbrjY4IwB.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42500000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":292011,\"title\":\"Stardom 5★STAR Grand Prix 2024\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bnCzjWDi1nZnNtm1LwjxnOu7rBv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42500000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":281671,\"title\":\"WWE Superstar Profiles\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wTOC5twk3sWIX2JEM99aeJHBuaK.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42000000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":291769,\"title\":\"Stardom Spring Vacation 2025 ~Hi Hi! Okinawa~\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jWpdzQVBPZZFAQhqOhqqEFDGNAm.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42000000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":2888,\"title\":\"WWE Confidential\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1nyAIu28i0l5qehmgc4kGv4Ku7B.jpg\",\"rating\":9.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41875,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":31991,\"title\":\"WWE NXT\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9nLBX5Bf7PW4FAaWJLXpFFdeTlV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4176470588235294,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":281678,\"title\":\"WWE Raw Classics\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f6xIVdQeAKVL8qZR1500MKUTtLe.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4166666666666667,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":255028,\"title\":\"Dream Star★Fighting Marigold\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dHSuQm8El99NMiN4MXrhjCNnrmw.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4166666666666667,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":3894,\"title\":\"WWE ECW\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h3qIiG22Uy62ZgLLtXkh5PdfiSL.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4118421052631579,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":533,\"title\":\"WWE Velocity\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/usNc42eETTOWsGOTj9HlYwfQi5H.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41125,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Smoky Mountain Wrestling - 1994\",\"seasonOverview\":\"Relive some of the most exciting in-ring events of the early-1990s. This season features some of the earliest matches of WWE Superstars like Chris Jericho, Lance Storm, and more.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gHxM7RqvX8mJF5cFoUo7oj4tf68.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"1994-02-19\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Smoky Mountain Wrestling - Feb. 19, 1994\",\"overview\":\"When Dutch Mantell signs The Thrillseekers to Smokey Mountain Wrestling, Chris Jericho & Lance Storm promise to turn up the voltage by bringing their high-octane brand of athleticism to the Tag Team Division. Plus, SMW Heavyweight Champion The Dirty White Boy sends a message to Prime Time Brian Lee and Tammy Fytch and more.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jvkO6aFA87pmveGZ1Jc8dXwyS4j.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1994-02-19\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Smoky Mountain Wrestling - Feb. 26, 1994\",\"overview\":\"Bobby Blaze teams with The Rock 'n' Roll Express to take on Killer Kyle and SMW Tag Team Champions The Heavenly Bodies. Chris Candido's search to find someone who can defeat Robbie Eagle for the Beat the Champ Television Championship leads him to the man known as The Hornet. Plus, Prime Time Brian Lee in action and more.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lP5FrnYg9JbT9U5z4ghdmCKKVtp.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1994-02-26\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Smoky Mountain Wrestling - Mar. 19, 1994\",\"overview\":\"After weeks of anticipation, Chris Jericho & Lance Storm make their in-ring debut in Smokey Mountain Wrestling as The Thrillseekers take on The Infernos. The rivalry between Tracy Smothers and Chris Candido reaches new heights as they face off in a Ladder Match for a cash prize and much more.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9kuoZl6uxyAldC4ZIc15NjWYYvC.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1994-03-19\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Smoky Mountain Wrestling - Apr. 02, 1994\",\"overview\":\"Larry Santo & Mike Sampson take on The Thrillseekers. The rivalry between Tammy Fytch and the Dirty White Girl escalates when Fytch introduces her new ally. Plus, The Rock 'n' Roll Express face off against the team of Chris Candido & Prime Time Brian Lee in the main event, Mike Furnas defends his Beat the Champ Television Championship, and more.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1foIOqaPg1V60KYSBxpRTep48xN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1994-04-02\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Smoky Mountain Wrestling - Apr. 30, 1994\",\"overview\":\"With Commissioner Bob Armstrong enlisting \\\"Macho Man\\\" Randy Savage for Volunteer Slam III, Jim Cornette decides to give both men a look at what they have in store as Bruiser Bedlam faces off against Tracy Smothers. Plus, another tag team takes exception to the success of The Thrillseekers, Jake \\\"The Snake\\\" Roberts gives a history lesson, and more.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1kb2uks1fGWv7i8kRwCvYqGkrYa.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1994-04-30\",\"runtime\":38},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Smoky Mountain Wrestling - May. 07, 1994\",\"overview\":\"Chris Jericho & Lance Storm and Well Dunn face off in the main event. With his upcoming title defense against Jake \\\"The Snake\\\" Roberts approaching, SMW Heavyweight Champion The Dirty White Boy warms up by going one-on-one with The Dark Secret. Plus, Bruiser Bedlam in action, a look at the recent SMW Tag Team Championship picture, and more.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ze4ZwGCpmVcbxv7Ua82AbBFnujB.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1994-05-07\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Smoky Mountain Wrestling - Jul. 09, 1994\",\"overview\":\"Jim Cornette takes exception to fans of Smokey Mountain Wrestling showing The Thrillseekers their appreciation with a special gift. Jake \\\"The Snake\\\" Roberts orchestrates a trap for The Dirty White Boy. Plus, Tammy Fytch gets her team in a hairy situation, Tracy Smothers defends his Beat the Champ Television Championship, and more.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5anIIBZRRc7GFnrcVsK1kU03l6n.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1994-07-09\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Smoky Mountain Wrestling - Jul. 16, 1994\",\"overview\":\"In retaliation for being humiliated by The Thrillseekers, video footage reveals Jim Cornette getting a measure of revenge on Lance Storm and Chris Jericho. With more than championship gold on the line, Tracy Smothers defends his Beat the Champ Television Championship against Prime Time Brian Lee in the main event.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1994-07-16\",\"runtime\":38},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Smoky Mountain Wrestling - Jul. 23, 1994\",\"overview\":\"While Jim Cornette and his minions protest Bob Armstrong enlisting Road Warrior Hawk for their upcoming Six-Man Tag Team match, Smokey Mountain Wrestling gets a taste of South Central as The Gangstas make their debut. Despite their recent attack at the hands of The Heavenly Bodies, The Thrillseekers return to action.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7cGG1WEuQzhnseIPkrvtKxY44Zx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1994-07-23\",\"runtime\":39},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Smoky Mountain Wrestling - Aug. 13, 1994\",\"overview\":\"The Thrillseekers look to get a measure of revenge on Jim Cornette and his team of The Heavenly Bodies as they face off in tag team action. Plus, The Gangstas, Chris Candido and Prime Time Brian Lee, The Rock 'n' Roll Express, and many more are all here for this unforgettable Night of Legends.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1U8IbYMXgegR9c7Xxut1hysA7yx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"1994-08-13\",\"runtime\":45}],\"firstAirDate\":\"1994-02-19\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}